Z||000016||FIEROCIOUS||10-17-2000||02:15 AM||||When I found my Fiero at a dealership they wanted 6200.00 for it (87 GT) with power windows as the only option! the dealer is a big time Fiero collector and has a few 88 gt T tops come in ocationaly. Well I didn't buy it for 6200.00! First I offered him 3500.00 but they said no 5700.00, then I waited another month offered 3500.00 they said "no 5000.00." I waited another month offered them 3500.00 they said "no 4000.00." I waited another month told them they I knew they had the car on the lot for six months and that I knew they had to pay lot fees on it, offered them 3000.00 for it they said "no 3400.00 out the door" I said were do I sign!<BR>It is the best Fiero I've seen to date for sale around here and I've had absolutely no problems with it! Come to find out it was the dealerships owners personal Fiero! Thus the price.||||reg||1
