Z||000020||2M4 Dale||10-17-2000||01:45 PM||||As far as Fieros being "classics" I believe that, in time, each and every one of them will be classics. Of course the rarer models will always bring a premium but in 30 years from now a 87 base coupe (for example) in excellent condition WILL be a Classic. I can remember when the GTO was the classic and the LeMans was not...But that story has changed somewhat. Also the 57 Chevy...once upon a time the four door models weren't worth the time of day...lol. Anyone check the collector market on these lately.<P>The market value of ALL Fieros seem to be going up...with the GT's and Formula's leading the way and thats good !<P>We have the edge right now. We know what's good and what's not. New enthusiasts will probably have to suffer a Fiero learning curve...Just like most of us did.<P>I have way more $$$ invested in my coupe than the current market value...but...I believe the market will come to me with enough time.||||reg||6
Z||000021||RobertVol||10-17-2000||03:00 PM||||Well what do you know. He called back and said he would take $3300.00 for it. hmmm<BR>Uhh I said no. I found a much better car for alot less. (check Ebay Post) and then he said well how about $3000.00? since AND I QUOTE " know so much about these CARS!!!" <P>Uhh I dont think me knowing them should determine my buy price... Idiot. I said no thanks. Well I hope none of the our friends in the North FL area are looking at this car. I havnt heard from them but if they are Phew! look out. <BR>I hope he calls back one more time. I will then offer 2200.00 since he was an idiot at haggling ||||reg||8
Z||000022||batboy||10-17-2000||11:03 PM||||I'd walk away from that Fiero, it'll be a nightmare, trust me. That car sounds like it was not loved. Find a Fiero that the owner obviously respected and took care of. Fieros like you are describing are a dime a dozen. Walk away...no...run away from that car.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/batkid3.gif">  <B>BATBOY</B><BR>85 SE with 350 Chevy V8 (Batmobile)<BR>85 GT (daily driver), & 87 SE (dead)||||reg||1
